<b>דין לבישת בגדים. ובו ו סעיפים:</b><br>לא ילבש <i data-commentator="Turei Zahav" data-order="1"></i>&lt;b&gt;The law of <i data-commentator="Magen Avraham" data-order="1"></i> <i data-commentator="Mishnah Berurah" data-label="א"></i> wearing garments. It(<i data-commentator="Be'er HaGolah" data-label="א" data-order="1"></i> contains six) <i data-commentator="Ba'er Hetev" data-order="1"></i> clauses:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One must not don his robe while seated (Tur); rather he should take his robe and put his head and arms into it while still lying down,<i data-commentator="Mishnah Berurah" data-label="ב"></i> so that when he rises he is covered.
